          "ruleIndex": 6,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Missing security headers, transport security misconfiguration — No issue identified: mindguard.site security headers / TLS config\n\nHeaders reviewed: only CSP 'upgrade-insecure-requests'; no HSTS/X-Frame-Options/X-Content-Type-Options/Referrer-Policy. On a pure static brochure site with no cookies/auth this is at most Low/Informational hardening advice, not a reportable vulnerability; http→https 301 redirect is present. Recorded as observation, not filed."
          },
          "locations": [
