          "message": {
            "text": "Open redirect / attacker-influenced anchor target — Ruled out: Outbound link / redirect surface (mindguard.site anchors & Cal.com embed)\n\nStatic + dynamic: all link hrefs are hardcoded constants (grep of `href: \"` in app code shows only `#platform #method #cases #security #faq #contact #top` and `https://mindguardredteam.com`); zero `location.assign` / `location.replace` / `location =` / `window.open` calls in the bundle. Runtime query of all <a> elements returned only the same static list, no dynamic href construction anywhere. No redirect parameter exists to abuse."
